 this can't be a type II region.\n\n![](images/eb/eb34633d98011ed7050694c722bc7c736a95939783efec3321d95517695642e2.png)\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446089 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186446092 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446089 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "24b1c7cb-ecec-5845-8416-fdfafa79a79d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446089 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186446088 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446090 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186446089 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446090 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "42ed5761-ab81-502e-952a-3422383e386b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446090 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186339069 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446091 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6b389470-3267-59d1-924e-08b2f27327ab" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446091 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186389594 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446092 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186446091 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446092 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "79b60224-d789-538c-8707-f34af9a3d64e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446092 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186403564 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446093 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186446090 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446093 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c93d77e3-7651-52c2-a428-7ad850967a27" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186446093 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186393194 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
